health might do to them?

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:37.845
- Yeah great question.

00:12:37.845 --> 00:12:40.329
So, you know, I think
obviously there's the shock

00:12:40.329 --> 00:12:42.270
of forced displacement
affects all age groups

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:45.287
and in different ways,
I think for adolescents

00:12:45.287 --> 00:12:48.010
a few critical things, one, it often leads

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:51.520
to fairly severe disruptions
in education, right?

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:54.170
So they're sort of either
out of school, permanently

00:12:55.743 --> 00:12:59.000
or out of school for long
periods of time that's

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.210
