00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.830
But also, you know, particularly

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:08.060
for girls can lead to early
marriage early childbearing

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:10.330
which has its own set
of health consequences.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:14.550
And for boys can end
up in child labor again

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:16.970
with potential physical
health consequences.

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:19.264
Another particularly critical point

00:13:19.264 --> 00:13:22.670
